:Class MockRequest
⍝ Lightweight mock of Jarvis Request for unit testing Stark's _Dispatch.

    :Field Public Instance Method←''
    :Field Public Instance Endpoint←''
    :Field Public Instance QueryParams←0 2⍴0
    :Field Public Instance Payload←''
    :Field Public Instance Body←''
    :Field Public Instance PathParams
    :Field Public Instance Response
    :Field Public Instance Headers←0 2⍴⊂''
    :Field Public Instance Cookies←0 2⍴⊂''
    :Field Public Instance UserID←''
    :Field Public Instance Password←''

    ∇ make args
      :Access Public
      :Implements Constructor
      ⍝ args: method endpoint [headers], headers an N×2 matrix of name/value pairs
      (Method Endpoint)←2↑args
      :If 2<≢args ⋄ Headers←3⊃args ⋄ :EndIf
      Payload←⎕NS ''
      PathParams←⎕NS ''
      Response←⎕NS ''
      Response.(Status StatusText Payload)←0 'OK' ''
      Response.Headers←0 2⍴'' ''
    ∇

    ∇ {r}←{message}Fail status
      :Access Public
      :If r←0≠1↑status
          Response.Status←status
      :EndIf
    ∇

    ∇ {status}←{statusText}SetStatus status
      :Access Public
      :If status≠0
          Response.Status←status
      :EndIf
    ∇

    ∇ r←GetHeader name
      :Access Public
      r←((⎕C Headers[;1])⍳⊂⎕C name)⊃Headers[;2],⊂''
    ∇

    ∇ {(name value)}←name SetHeader value
      :Access Public
      Response.Headers⍪←name(∊⍕value)
    ∇

    ∇ value←GetCookie name
      :Access Public
      value←(Cookies[;1]⍳⊆,name)⊃Cookies[;2],⊂''
    ∇

:EndClass
